From 6d72619295c023b274dda351bc95f2ae1afecf9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:40:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] proto: P2b-T3 route collects multi-writer tensors before
 physicalization

route runs desugarMultiWriters before physicalizeForRoute, so a reader of a
multi-writer name is wired to the sum collector instead of the last writer.
compile_eq_physical_route gains the collection stage; compile_wellFormed's
statement is unchanged. Fixtures RT1-RT6 (CollectTest), acset fixture 10.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 leanncd/LeanNCD/Bridge/Agreement.lean         | 43 ++++++----
 leanncd/LeanNCD/DSL/Pipeline/Lowering.lean    | 19 ++++-
 .../DSL/Pipeline/ScheduledValidation.lean     |  5 +-
